# Entry Main: the exact name @ in the record `return` of data is not the contract of a reference (the book
# #return-in-data). The record is read by its form: the WORD of a name describes no result, as the record of the written
# `return: @` alone is the reference. A call in a value context over that data answers 5 before any effect: C does not
# run, D\seen 0, r 0.
int: r 0
D:
    int: seen 0
    return: `@`
    C:
        node\seen := 1
        return: 7
    end: C
end: D
---
Main:
    node\r := D\C()
